sequenceDiagram
actor U as 用户
participant V as MainWindow (View)
participant C as LoginController
participant H as HttpClient
participant M as LoginModel
U->>V: 点击取消
V-->>C: cancelRequested()
C->>C: 保存当前 id，然后清零 m_requestId
C->>H: cancel(id)
H->>H: 移除请求，断开回调，abort，deleteLater
Note over H: 取消后不发出成功或失败信号
C->>M: failLogin(已取消登录)
M-->>C: changed()
C->>V: applyLoginState(LoggedOut)
